WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,500
Yoyo

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:07,750
Where is Yoyo? Ou

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:14,240
You forgot to go and play with your pretty brother, Yoyo

4
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,440
Such a big thing

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,840
How can you forget

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:24,670
Tell Aunt Ying that you are sorry, grandma.

7
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:25,970
Slightly calm

8
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:37,720
Aunt Ying hasn’t explained her purpose of coming yet.

9
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:40,180
You are the little lucky star of our Ying family

10
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:44,210
You are the god of our Ying family, Youyou

11
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,700
Auntie, I really don’t know how to thank you.

12
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,560
You can be your aunt's daughter

13
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:54,060
What color sack do you like?

14
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,420
What color room do you like?

15
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:58,020
Auntie will decorate it for you

16
00:00:58,510 --> 00:00:59,810
what is going on

17
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:02,410
You are not here to settle accounts with Yoyo.

18
00:01:02,910 --> 00:01:04,210
Where is this?

19
00:01:04,210 --> 00:01:06,410
It’s not enough for me to thank you so much.

20
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:08,610
I was originally going to give Wu Hao a summer camp

21
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,400
There was an accident at that summer camp today

22
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:13,000
Fortunately no one died

23
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:15,650
If it weren't for Yoyo

24
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:17,150
child in accident

25
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:19,250
Maybe our family is fine

26
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:23,170
Just be fine

27
00:01:23,470 --> 00:01:25,070
It’s really a blessing from Bodhisattva

28
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:28,420
It’s Youyou’s blessing

29
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:30,250
Just a coincidence

30
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:32,450
Have a three-and-a-half-year-old child

31
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:38,970
What kind of contribution can you make?

32
00:01:39,570 --> 00:01:41,570
Brother Wuyou learned how to make cakes for a day

33
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:43,070
Do you want to try it?

34
00:01:43,170 --> 00:01:55,540
of course
